{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/44d312f7d8c178c38eb00cf68017ebd7.avif?t=1768209281\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras_big/44d312f7d8c178c38eb00cf68017ebd7.avif?t=1768209281 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Plush Shop Simulator \u2014 a cozy shop management game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small city store and grow it into the ultimate plushie paradise. Stock your shelves with adorable plush toys, stationery, and mystery blind boxes. Keep your customers happy, customize your shop, and become the go-to destination for all things soft and squishy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/1d9d6577ec65f79a1ff21d90c34b0364.avif?t=1768209281\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/3d975c92e87e0c7e81a53b845e1350fd.poster.avif?t=1768209281\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/3d975c92e87e0c7e81a53b845e1350fd.webm?t=1768209281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750820/extras/3d975c92e87e0c7e81a53b845e1350fd.mp4?t=1768209281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, price, and sell a variety of cute items, from plush toys to notebooks and blind boxes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to trends and manage your inventory wisely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p clas